  "text": "Beastmaster Durzag Combat Achievements\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis guide will go over how to complete the Grandmaster speed kill Combat achievement for Beastmaster Durzag.\n​\nGeneral Information\n⬥ The base must avoid being melee'd by Beastmaster Durzag so that he does not spawn the 3rd pet. They can do this by running between corners of the room and using  or  to avoid melee swipes.\n⬥ The base should be the only person to pre-vuln Beastmaster Durzag to avoid other members getting aggro.\n​\nPositioning\n⬥ Once the waves are about to end, everyone but base should stand on the tile below.\n\n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAbilities\n⬥ Darkness \n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \n    • Have all 4 conjures selected\nOther\n⬥ Equilibrium \n⬥ Ring of Vigour Passive Unlocked \n⬥ Pray  and  or \n⬥ Ripper Demon  with \n    •  autofire set to 1\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Grandmaster Speed Killer\n​\n⬥  and  can be used in place of  and  but may be less consistent\n⬥ Runes for  are not necessary but can be brought\n\nWaves\nPrebuild 12  + 5  +  (if available), have conjures summoned ready for Beastmaster Durzag's Spawn.\nRotation\n0:01 on timer\nOne person \n0:03 on timer\n →  →  → tc +  →   +  →   →  →  →  →  →  →  → finish with  if needed\n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kill\n⬥ Grandmaster Speed Killer Example Kill\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Beastmaster Durzag Combat Achievements ​ Introduction This guide will go over how to complete the Grandmaster speed kill Combat achievement for Beastmaster Durzag. ​ General Information ⬥ The base must avoid being melee'd by Beastmaster Durzag so that he does not spawn the 3rd pet. They can do this by running between corners of the room and using or to avoid melee swipes. ⬥ The base should be the only person to pre-vuln Beastmaster Durzag to avoid other members getting aggro. ​ Positioning ⬥ Once the waves are about to end, everyone but base should stand on the tile below. ​ Abilities ⬥ Darkness ⬥ Conjure Undead Army • Have all 4 conjures selected Other ⬥ Equilibrium ⬥ Ring of Vigour Passive Unlocked ⬥ Pray and or ⬥ Ripper Demon with • autofire set to 1 ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Grandmaster Speed Killer ​ ⬥ and can be used in place of and but may be less consistent ⬥ Runes for are not necessary but can be brought Waves Prebuild 12 + 5 + (if available), have conjures summoned ready for Beastmaster Durzag's Spawn. Rotation 0:01 on timer One person 0:03 on timer → → → tc + → + → → → → → → → → finish with if needed ​ Example Kill ⬥ Grandmaster Speed Killer Example Kill",
